<title>USA: CTC Communications Corp Q2 full results.</title>
<headline>CTC Communications Corp Q2 full results.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					    Sep 30, 1996   Sep 30, 1995</p>
<p> Network Service Commission Income $ 6,827,449    $ 6,899,380</p>
<p> Resale Product Usage Income	   2,789,619	1,296,139</p>
<p>	 Total Revenue		     9,617,068	8,195,519</p>
<p>	 Net Income			  1,048,828	  945,500</p>
<p> Earnings per share			     0.10	     0.09</p>
<p> Weighted Shares Outstanding	  10,867,983     10,575,546</p>
<p>						 Six months ended</p>
<p>					    Sep 30, 1996    Sep 30,1995</p>
<p> Network Service Commission Income $13,575,690    $12,756,080</p>
<p> Resale Product Usage Income	   5,048,838	2,344,715</p>
<p>	 Total Revenue		    18,624,528     15,100,795</p>
<p>	 Net Income			  2,243,014	1,637,750</p>
<p> Earnings per share			     0.21	     0.16</p>
<p> Weighted Shares Outstanding	  10,924,506     10,460,146</p>
<p>Note: Earnings per share and weighted shares outstanding for the periods indicated above reflect the 3-for-2 stock split declared on July 13, 1995, and the 2-for-1 stock split declared on Oct 10, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
